{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cep6SnMdQv4yWWGyhsb6r","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Shipment Feature - File Structure and Key Locations\n\nHere's what I found in the shipment feature:\n\n### Directory Structure\n```\n./sample-service/src/\n├── main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/\n│   └── shipment/\n│       ├── Shipment.kt              (Entity/Model)\n│       ├── ShipmentController.kt    (Controller/API)\n│       └── ShipmentRepository.kt    (Repository)\n└── test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/\n    └── shipment/\n        └── ShipmentControllerTest.kt (Tests)\n```\n\n### Key Files and Their Roles\n\n1. **Entity/Model**: `/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/Shipment.kt`\n   - Defines `Shipment` data class with shipmentId, orderId, carrier, and status\n   - Defines `ShipmentStatus` enum (CREATED, CONFIRMED, CANCELLED)\n   - Defines `CreateShipmentRequest` for API input\n\n2. **Controller/API Endpoints**: `/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt`\n   - Base path: `/shipments`\n   - POST `/shipments` - Create a new shipment\n   - GET `/shipments/{shipmentId}` - Retrieve shipment by ID\n   - GET `/shipments` - List all shipments (sorted by ID)\n   - No service layer; logic is directly in controller\n\n3. **Repository**: `/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentRepository.kt`\n   - Class name: `InMemoryShipmentRepository`\n   - In-memory data store using ConcurrentHashMap\n   - Methods: `save()`, `existsById()`, `findById()`, `findAll()`, `clear()`\n\n4. **Tests**: `/sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt`\n   - Integration tests using Spring Boot Test and MockMvc\n   - Tests creation, duplicate detection, retrieval, not-found errors, and listing\n   - Baseline tests that must keep passing (pre-BE-003 state)\n\n### Notable Architecture Observations\n- **No Service Layer**: Business logic exists directly in the controller\n- **In-Memory Storage**: Uses ConcurrentHashMap (no database)\n- **Error Handling**: Uses custom exceptions (`ConflictException`, `ResourceNotFoundException`) with error codes\n- **Status Lifecycle**: Current baseline only supports CREATED status; confirmation/transitions not yet implemented"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":588,"cache_read_input_tokens":11087,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":588,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DpQjd3E2DPeegshTK1uDgr","session_id":"fcff379c-4202-4774-b9ca-fe61e7dad979","uuid":"6723f0b0-7ee2-43eb-b14a-203464d32c51","timestamp":"2026-09-07T12:40:25.248Z","request_id":"req_011Cep6SmaVhFNJJVB51qSJX","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Explore shipment feature structure and find key files"}
